14dq|n|A young goat. ; A young child or infant; hence, a simple person, easily imposed on. ; A kind of leather made of the skin of the young goat, or of the skin of rats, etc. ; Gloves made of kid. ; A small wooden mess tub; -- a name given by sailors to one in which they receive their food. ; A fagot; a bundle of heath and furze.	a:1qk8,87,5;1dub,37,2;16i4,25,2~1qk8,87,5;1dub,37,2;16i4,25,2	n:1siy,27,3~1siy,27,3
